    <pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 15:45:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>阿弥晚安：雨夜，一个人在家</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="29">00:00:29</a> 躲进一个没人知道，也没人发现的世界。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="87">00:01:27</a> 当视觉消失，身体开始重新认识黑暗…</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="169">00:02:49</a> 现在这里只剩我一个人了，海风肆虐，直到树木的腐臭味钻入鼻腔</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="310">00:05:10</a> 如果只剩下自己一个人，生活会变成什么样？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="403">00:06:43</a> 再过几天就29岁了，大概会忘记这个雨夜，就像忘记多年以前，为29岁许下的诺言一样。</span></p><p><span>下周三见，祝你晚安</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgY6baUR4Lrd7Kq6Q5AKweOJt4O8.PNG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnm0Xt9mKG2yzI5eZyh4LiE1PTyJ.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fies77z_X5ixL6A3Z0iKe-8h2qOe.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpjx7xGdfE1_U85qyJ7GcqeysbId.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu8f03r15yTvScFYhohPV6DyXmBL.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnxkiJ5DDMVzf7tBGIIfmgXmbwtJ.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqiA7p_-0YtvVIhfMseTx6zEXqwt.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgbTwbM5-3dK9DpVBC8c6Tx27ehf.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsf4OcUqI_gu5qFer1mHzyKTRRBe.PNG"><p></p>]]></description>
