  <item>
    <title>245.对话五条人，22年前摆地摊的烦躁少年...</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6af466eb14d01a26f8a86a08</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6af466eb14d01a26f8a86a08</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 13:04:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>阿弥晚安：对话五条人，22年前摆地摊的烦躁少年...</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="156">00:02:36</a> 关于灵感，关于写歌，如何捕捉现实中的浓缩</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="288">00:04:48</a> 每场演出都会打破原本的叙述逻辑，在适宜的时候，一直躁下去…</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="440">00:07:20</a> 城中村美学、塑料美学，一场和时代下的奇妙缘分</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="578">00:09:38</a> “方言”对情感的表达是具有独特性的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="841">00:14:01</a> 十年水流东，十年水流西，未来会流向哪里呢？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1091">00:18:11</a> “文艺”这个词对于现在是怎样的存在</span></p><p><span>下周三见，祝你晚安</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgY6baUR4Lrd7Kq6Q5AKweOJt4O8.PNG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgwiJtBE4NsXpEo1oWWP405JBWQO.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl9Ig-sjDX_8uJ8RetZTsIxZRjOG.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqcVxanWLVmCkwlQ5MBiX5EGVCzV.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp9FIOB67m7_UKEwlRP2O1qsIFNX.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmMGvjFHsXWoWJna-laUZPhvQqJl.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqpbl5A3Nk-6IkJnduc7r4WUc7zP.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtOBP8F5mO_P1Uw-VY4p3L77Bwxu.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgztKS8O9Uhi6Ao5NAxj-anW01ld.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgCwKRuA8R8isgkxLgN1xiZe5DwL.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkG1E3pn47yhVLCfDW-IcqxGwDbC.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsf4OcUqI_gu5qFer1mHzyKTRRBe.PNG"><p></p>]]></description>
