    <pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 17:32:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>阿弥晚安：结婚之后，如何摆脱“无聊”（s）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="27">00:00:27</a> 长期关系，如何消灭“无聊”（无聊是人类的常态）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="369">00:06:09</a> 夫妻的兴趣不一，怎么样才能“和平共处”？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="909">00:15:09</a> 相同的职业，与不同的职业</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1236">00:20:36</a> 夫妻旅行美食各点各的，当社会的包容浓缩至家庭的包容——无需在口味的一致性获得彼此的认可</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">00:25:00</a> 「无聊时刻」的观影推荐：《纳米比亚的沙漠》和《密阳》</span></p><p><span>下周三见，祝你晚安</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgY6baUR4Lrd7Kq6Q5AKweOJt4O8.PNG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnpSRaH8B0XfmBFnzUVOZrHzdI1L.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiAQZlETc0Sj1mjlm_NT6VAspUjj.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgWSgAAjyZ7xCQC4VYGJ0LDkQ3Ol.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj5crvBbg24YsfOTime9aGKou3AR.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftwd1TVW7QcHvOk8Ze8LaR1DttBZ.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsf4OcUqI_gu5qFer1mHzyKTRRBe.PNG"><p><span>（插图：Dadu Shin）</span></p>]]></description>
