    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>阿弥晚安：凌晨5点的东莞，电影院人山人海…</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="27">00:00:27</a> 在深夜开往东莞，看一场凌晨5点结束的巨幕电影</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="194">00:03:14</a>  诺兰是一个不使用智能手机的“古代人”，却在离谱的现代摄影技术上走到了极致</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="214">00:03:34</a>  执念，是成为顶级创作者的必要条件</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="452">00:07:32</a>  “你最想要的，是你最无法拥有的。而你最无法拥有的，正是你曾经拥有、又已经失去的”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="687">00:11:27</a>   我们究竟在被什么吸引，是哀鸣</span></p><p><span>下周三见，祝你晚安</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgY6baUR4Lrd7Kq6Q5AKweOJt4O8.PNG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtEHkxsd-S5WTyrkuQLfRIbSNE5D.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnoIenp4j0wJ4R6Ez3m3m21r6fNi.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjQTh18NEytUxnk67kFPu577NfxO.WEBP"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjOA8O-wwD9v6YRSH6gIqF6OD-bh.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgeH4hxnCtlj3OhyH7OpjC_C4z96.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvSj8_QRe2C27KbUhGIZfoPAo8oG.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fir40BGLr66dIz-OTZEentIlMJ54.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkIFoAcb1G2wsG0rL6wFDLR0x21e.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhlXpzzRxZsG8gt8fJ22SQwFB82z.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsf4OcUqI_gu5qFer1mHzyKTRRBe.PNG"><p></p>]]></description>
