    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aa15fa79d32647781669fc3</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 13:32:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>阿弥晚安：莫名其妙。厌恶人类</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="53">00:00:53</a>这几天都在追逐柯布西耶的建筑，旅行好像就是如此兴奋，却又如此疲劳</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">00:02:02</a> 住进马赛公寓，为没有地下停车场的建筑而头疼….</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="265">00:04:25</a> 生活在变化，就像不断变暖的气候一样</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="356">00:05:56</a> 看见住客留给房东的纸条，上面写满了可爱的文字，好像人类，也没有这么讨厌</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="516">00:08:36</a> 不要吝啬去记录旅行，即便是没有那么完美，但仍然要相信，晴朗明媚的人类，总有一天，会找到属于自己的“光辉城市”</span></p><p><span>下周三见，祝你晚安</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgY6baUR4Lrd7Kq6Q5AKweOJt4O8.PNG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqtIR_7rrOnQofLIkCrmDGBpS1J7.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn6H63I8TsOdALnh8n7XugjEltyS.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn6bTOQA8MnOGzF2z8nXOWecae4m.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm5jg2494qEFYKMirfB3lDoFECAV.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoLP5Yp2DMKsSude0apRtcYQWvKf.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkL-j1ZhCV8G6d2XIXFge2vqocbW.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp8DRgq47OYLoDRfcdO6xVBTG7NK.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpHFv10hxfYNFBSaihxTjHkE-yNk.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsTPuOBs7ECZDeDGZMDrd_Q7H19X.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjeZTvfO7124vOQxoKbQqNCjb1sa.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft3MebfY9CVfaCp_k-bCpZvcpkD4.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiK-Ldbi9ZGDI3EA4Ueb_G79Y_b6.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsf4OcUqI_gu5qFer1mHzyKTRRBe.PNG"><p></p>]]></description>
