    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>阿弥晚安：“人们偷偷看着AI翻译本，不敢声张”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="22">00:00:22</a> 人们偷偷看着AI翻译本，不敢声张</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">00:01:10</a> 比起替代，应该更警惕偷偷的“替换”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="187">00:03:07</a> AI时代的信、达、雅</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="294">00:04:54</a> 被迫将作品递交给AI，才是作家的活路？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="320">00:05:20</a> 过去，现在，和未来……</span></p><p><span>下周三见，祝你晚安</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgY6baUR4Lrd7Kq6Q5AKweOJt4O8.PNG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoDw4r0toUMK00KuhHg1CkAlxO8s.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtvUn0vEcHUNxGczGaQ-aR26YSMO.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpQlUbJpjzZSy8GjtfsOT1utPkBT.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuuvoWILac-1_1WNCJi7pZ-gmnMn.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh_TYrhujrYjAQl-sN1CNVVWo8Hx.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtBOeXCgEtICn9kFYilRZN1Rzsmd.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FktqsP2ldwUFqYjTG00w3XkDR19K.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsf4OcUqI_gu5qFer1mHzyKTRRBe.PNG"><p><span>（插图：Victoria Semykina、Stefan Johansson、Ado Makiko Watanabe）</span></p>]]></description>
