    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a57b1c8016dcc7e0542cb98</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 15 Jul 2026 16:30:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>阿弥晚安：压力大的时候会做些什么？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="31">00:00:31</a> 压力大的时候，摸摸小猫像按下某个神秘开关</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="104">00:01:44</a> 年少的夜晚被公交车和长路拉长，留下幼稚又珍贵的记忆</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">00:03:30</a> S说人总是有办法以任何一种方式走入一段回忆，现在没有，也会在未来。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="402">00:06:42</a> 和朋友闲聊几句，回到那时一起分享有关村上村树新书开售的喜悦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="452">00:07:32</a> 在巨大的混沌中，用一种平和的心情，去活下来，大概是未来必须要学会的事情吧</span></p><p><span>下周三见，祝你晚安</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgY6baUR4Lrd7Kq6Q5AKweOJt4O8.PNG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FheOpQqbSaiCx3FjQJqQbZzVY75m.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjwbVmZxoluJLEuFRzsdf04g2mLX.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjIIq2ITqJPIJZUPXoY5P8Hafkmq.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm1dsDnfd5hwbtd1po2KLE4835kI.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrthD230cu1FaaYaSGnxMc0jNMnN.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl_R3bZhK27qAT9fsyFLOkfuhz0L.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu-0MB0mIV-fVNcIx59A1jHwMRdy.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsf4OcUqI_gu5qFer1mHzyKTRRBe.PNG"><p></p>]]></description>
