    <pubDate>Wed, 24 Jun 2026 17:44:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>阿弥晚安：有AI以后，毕业了怎么办？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="28">00:00:28</a> 又是一年毕业季，12 年里世界已经变了很多</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="43">00:00:43</a> “阿弥晚安”像一份和听众签订的契约，记录真实的时代线索</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="129">00:02:09</a> AI 正从聊天窗口走向 Agent 工作流，改变人类的工作方法</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="209">00:03:29</a> token 逐渐成为新的生产燃料，推动效率，也重新计算人的价值</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="250">00:04:10</a> AI幻境里调用的仍是人的创造力，而真正的局限正在被一点点消解</span></p><p><span>下周三见，祝你晚安</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgY6baUR4Lrd7Kq6Q5AKweOJt4O8.PNG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlajoxtBDSw6lUIH7ZgX9iz7CUuR.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtOWeNLKJUHWFq6VCZvgWqhZNOyX.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqp7RcxatCuPafqaKAcLA838ZSrT.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqzIx_IzXu5F95cUI8pRUO9wjQVd.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnSVT6gX0kZW3Wpr5E00w_BXKN8U.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm7SaXaqSROawWWNyLFi_JzjZ5AU.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft9utlyY8GGyNmwUE7WcvaUy4xGd.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrMYAE2v1gKy3xbE9Zy-09YvOqC1.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtLTo2_JVN0nT3xbXACYgvXOQozD.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk4gnzorRaHNvx4MC5MJ65wUCrhC.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsf4OcUqI_gu5qFer1mHzyKTRRBe.PNG"><p></p>]]></description>
