    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>&nbsp;阿弥晚安：捡回来的命，那就好好活下去！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="28">00:28</a> 既然是捡回来的命，那就好好活下去，带着更多的淡然与信念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">01:10</a> 时间一点点消磨着我对濒死的“恐惧”，生命变得更加宽容与从容</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="166">02:46</a> 我们租到了一个漏水房，经历了无法言说的一整年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="226">03:46</a> 散步，是疏通生命的通道，让身体和精神得到治愈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="333">05:33</a> 地板已经变得“伤痕累累”，就像婚姻和生活中不可避免的痕迹</span></p><span></span><p><span>下周三见，祝你晚安</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgY6baUR4Lrd7Kq6Q5AKweOJt4O8.PNG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkfoLVWbP7YR-RsIJG5PGBZEZCeT.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmM44OaSVrpp0V5zGuPuWfxRNUwT.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkEPCMpU4Qth8JCKlJcQqnMvEhrv.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlsRHOtRmhI9IdYZ4Vk-183Ivnew.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh-ztbU-CLEjZ4GVWBEXcv5bjc6v.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FogL_oXPQVtzxfaS4yAr89iNc65L.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsf4OcUqI_gu5qFer1mHzyKTRRBe.PNG"></figure>]]></description>
