  <item>
    <title>232.为什么⾟苦⼯作后，做家务会有幸福感？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69b17dc084bce022f9f37f6d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69b17dc084bce022f9f37f6d</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Mar 2026 14:39:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>阿弥晚安：为什么⾟苦⼯作后，做家务会有幸福感？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="24">00:24</a> ⼏包从免税店带回来的意⼤利⾯，把旅⾏拖进了⽇常。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="64">01:04</a> ⽔开、下盐、计时⼋分钟，锅⾥的秩序⽐⽣活更可靠。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="115">01:55</a> 有时候，洗⾐服和煮⾯，⽐什么都更像休息。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="248">04:08</a> 当分享变成被评价的⼊口，⼈就开始珍惜只属于⾃⼰的循环</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="283">04:43</a> ⽣活总在规律和新鲜之间摆动，没有标准答案。</span></p><span></span><p><span>下周三见，祝你晚安</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnjtygJVvnZcpGpVetozva7vFqmZ.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkaJWIP69fCTmvFnx8fQNW3qLsYu.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjD-rtz-rP8v08rFq3dMf4YCJ7GJ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/li9OpgoteNjgmc4KN_AEVhG9DI3J.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv-pTu8qCqxzOsMiH5bgNrxemaEn.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FthR6SiXYo7VTmapnGNCcEheltfM.JPG"></figure>]]></description>
